1
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:13,864
This program is intended for authorized F.A.L.C.O.N. personnel only.

2
00:00:14,564 --> 00:00:18,711
If you are not authorized personnel, please stop the tape now.

3
00:00:20,311 --> 00:00:21,024
Thank you.

4
00:00:25,324 --> 00:00:30,541
The Federal Agency for Liminal Classification & Occult Nature presents

5
00:00:32,341 --> 00:00:34,115
WATER SAFETY AND YOU

6
00:00:38,715 --> 00:00:41,925
Congratulations on your assignment to the poolrooms.

7
00:00:42,525 --> 00:00:44,424
The poolrooms have no known end.

8
00:00:45,024 --> 00:00:48,080
The water is always warm. Do not drink it.

9
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:50,496
The lights are always on.

10
00:00:50,996 --> 00:00:52,751
Except where they are not.

11
00:00:55,151 --> 00:00:56,581
You are not alone here.

12
00:01:01,881 --> 00:01:02,826
This is The Wader.

13
00:01:03,426 --> 00:01:06,299
It has no eyes. It does not need them.

14
00:01:07,999 --> 00:01:09,405
It hunts by sound.

15
00:01:17,005 --> 00:01:19,274
If you fall in, it will hear you.

16
00:01:19,574 --> 00:01:22,416
It is faster than you. Get out of the water.

17
00:01:24,316 --> 00:01:27,775
It cannot leave the water. Dry ground is safe.

18
00:01:31,975 --> 00:01:40,106
If you have just fallen in, it already knows where you are. Move away from that spot first. Then stop moving.

19
00:01:42,910 --> 00:01:45,280
It will search for you by feel.

20
00:02:00,130 --> 00:02:03,744
Most personnel who remain perfectly still are not found.

21
00:02:05,544 --> 00:02:07,159
Remain perfectly still.

22
00:02:12,059 --> 00:02:13,638
Listen for its clicking.

23
00:02:16,838 --> 00:02:18,464
If it screeches, move.

24
00:02:25,864 --> 00:02:29,641
If a member of your team is taken, do not attempt a rescue.

25
00:02:30,841 --> 00:02:34,131
It will be busy for a moment. Use this time.

26
00:02:36,731 --> 00:02:39,232
Taken personnel sometimes come back.

27
00:02:40,232 --> 00:02:42,084
Do not ask them about the water.

28
00:02:44,784 --> 00:02:45,409
Remember.

29
00:02:45,909 --> 00:02:46,823
Stay dry.

30
00:02:47,423 --> 00:02:48,391
Stay quiet.

31
00:02:48,991 --> 00:02:49,921
Stay still.

32
00:02:50,821 --> 00:02:52,056
And above all.

33
00:02:52,606 --> 00:02:53,706
Do not fall in.

34
00:02:56,406 --> 00:03:00,591
This concludes your orientation. Thank you for your service.

35
00:03:09,991 --> 00:03:14,247
It can hear yours.

